{
  "_note": "Najimi tokens, Darkroom: a warm near-black room with hairlines that stays out of the way. Every colour on screen is content (artwork, photos, renders, kelvin swatches, the face disc) plus one signal that means only 'Najimi is working'. Dark only. Edit this file, then run `pnpm --filter @najimi/tokens build` (generate + WCAG gate). Never edit generated/.",
  "_roles": {
    "canvas/panel/raised": "The room: page, cards and the run, chips and sub-panels. Depth by tint and a 1px line, never a shadow.",
    "line/line-strong": "Hairlines: every panel and chip / the composer, popovers and focused inputs.",
    "ink": "Text, icons and the one filled button.",
    "signal": "Najimi is working, or about to: the live dot, the running step, Send with text, focus. Nothing else.",
    "violet..butter": "Identity colours: a person's face disc only.",
    "paper/kraft/sticker/lime": "Legacy OurSpaces names mapped into the room; being removed from components."
  },
